{"reviewId": "17140765_85VFtQmRB", "review": {"abstract": "本轮房价的大底可能在2020年之后出现，亦即在2020年至2025年之间见底。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "chapterUid": 17, "content": "大周期趋势是对的，时间点可能差个几年，现在是2026年一月，中国的房地产还没有见到底。\n个人判断，2030年左右，中国的房地产才能真正的见底。\n这个期间，伴随着房产税的落地时间表有一些前后的变化。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "19627-19666", "createTime": 1767604534, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 17, "reviewId": "17140765_85VFtQmRB", "userVid": 17140765, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 17140765, "name": "悟远", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0012-nIFq~3eUfnuhBQRtomcLs10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "悟远", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书，修行", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "关注:老殷带你看真相", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-180", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 180}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 10, "likes": [{"userVid": 83339551, "name": "Terry Blunt", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/AxcvTqicb8yKwTFd9Ciahu2wGOLbs5r9QAAMyXsgADRx3cNsIXQt8F58ibgZYysC7GqIFCnHBu8sfo/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M11-0-50", "desc": "点评书籍", "title": "点评书籍", "levelIndex": 50}}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "这里周期对应是主导国-美国", "reviewId": "1